  "brain_first": "“先找到动作/结果，再向附近找直接原因。”",
  "sort_order": 1018,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 773
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Why did... / What caused... / What was the",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 774
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "reason for...?",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 775
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 776
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "原因题找 cause-effect chain。",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 777
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先找到动作/结果，再向附近找直接原因。”",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 778
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 文章可能给远背景、近原因和结果；正确答案通常回答题干那一步的直接原因。",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 779
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 780
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 定位题干事件。",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 781
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 向前后找 because / since / due to / so / therefore 或隐含因果。",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 782
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 区分“背景条件”和“直接触发”。",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 783
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 把选项改写成“X happened because ___”检查。",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 784
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 785
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 786
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 787
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 题干问“why mention” → 不是普通原因题，转到目的/例子作用",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 788
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 多个原因并列 → 看题干是否问 main reason",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 789
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 原因能直接解释题干事件。",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 790
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 若两个都是真实信息，选与题干动作距离更近、因果更直接的。",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 791
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 792
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "文章：天气变冷只是背景，活动取消是因为安全部门发布警报。问取消原因，应选警报而非“冬天到",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 793
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "了”。",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 794
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 795
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把时间先后当因果。",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 796
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把结果反过来当原因。",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 797
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 798
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 是否真的有因果？",
      "sourcePage": 29,
      "sourceIndex": 799
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 方向有没有反？",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 800
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 801
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 802
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 803
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 原因题找“为什么这一步发生”。",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 804
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 806
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. Why题先找什么？",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 807
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 原文A because B，选项写A leads to B，对吗？",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 808
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 背景事实与直接原因同时出现，优先？",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 809
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. “because/since/as”一定每题都有吗？",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 810
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 原因题正确选项需要额外常识吗？",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 811
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 题干动作/现象，再找直接原因。；2. 不一定，因果方向被换。；3. 直接解释题干事件的原因。；4. 不",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 812
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "一定，可通过语义关系判断。；5. 不应需要。",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 813
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R4 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R4”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 30,
      "sourceIndex": 814
    }
  ],
